1
00:00:05,660 --> 00:00:11,210
(Yowayowa Sensei)

2
00:01:30,600 --> 00:01:32,250
(Episode 2: Yowayowa After School)

3
00:01:32,260 --> 00:01:33,460
Okay. Gather up.

4
00:01:33,460 --> 00:01:36,550
We're doing fitness tests
in today's PE class.

5
00:01:36,550 --> 00:01:39,500
Our special guest is Hiwamura-sensei.

6
00:01:39,500 --> 00:01:41,610
MURMURING
Nice to meet you all.

7
00:01:41,610 --> 00:01:44,450
WHISPERING
Why is Kowakowa-sensei the guest?

8
00:01:44,450 --> 00:01:47,260
WHISPERING
We can't even escape her curse in PE class.

9
00:01:47,260 --> 00:01:51,800
Everyone thinks
my homeroom teacher is scary, 

10
00:01:51,800 --> 00:01:56,450
but she's actually
a hardworking Yowayowa-sensei.

11
00:01:56,450 --> 00:01:59,350
Hiwamura-sensei isn't very confident
in her stamina.

12
00:01:59,360 --> 00:02:02,420
So I asked if she'd like to observe

13
00:02:02,410 --> 00:02:04,060
and experience PE class firsthand.

14
00:02:05,360 --> 00:02:07,060
I'm worried.

15
00:02:07,060 --> 00:02:11,310
Hiwamura-sensei is
participating in PE class with students.

16
00:02:11,310 --> 00:02:15,100
Subjects like PE are
to be breezed through.

17
00:02:15,100 --> 00:02:18,300
Her precious stamina
shouldn't be wasted on this.

18
00:02:18,310 --> 00:02:20,420
Let's start with grip strength.

19
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:23,360
Abikura, you're class president, right?

20
00:02:23,350 --> 00:02:25,850
Pair up with Hiwamura-sensei for the test.

21
00:02:27,010 --> 00:02:28,520
PE class is the best!

22
00:02:28,900 --> 00:02:31,210
We'll measure your right hand first.

23
00:02:31,210 --> 00:02:31,900
Okay.

24
00:02:31,900 --> 00:02:33,890
I've been working out lately.

25
00:02:33,900 --> 00:02:35,110
I'll definitely do well this time.

26
00:02:43,860 --> 00:02:45,600
T-that's not right, sensei.

27
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:48,750
You need to release your grip
and straighten your back first.

28
00:02:48,750 --> 00:02:50,800
S-sorry.

29
00:02:50,810 --> 00:02:51,260
Great.

30
00:02:51,260 --> 00:02:51,910
STRAINING
Great.

31
00:02:51,910 --> 00:02:54,260
STRAINING
Thank goodness it's not another guy paired with sensei.

32
00:02:54,260 --> 00:02:55,660
GRIP STRENGTH OF A 7-YEAR-OLD GIRL
Grip, ten kilograms.

33
00:02:55,960 --> 00:02:58,000
STAGGERING
Four side-to-side jumps.

34
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:58,600
Four side-to-side jumps.

35
00:02:58,610 --> 00:02:59,160
Handball throw.

36
00:02:59,160 --> 00:02:59,960
TREMBLING, THUD
Handball throw.

37
00:02:59,950 --> 00:03:02,860
TREMBLING, THUD
She couldn't even hold the ball. Minus one meter.

38
00:03:03,360 --> 00:03:04,800
PANTING
50-meter dash.

39
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:08,200
PANTING
Including rest breaks, three minutes and ten seconds.

40
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:09,260
GASPING

41
00:03:09,260 --> 00:03:11,710
As usual, pathetically weak.

42
00:03:11,700 --> 00:03:14,000
A-are you okay, sensei?

43
00:03:14,750 --> 00:03:16,650
Last is the standing long jump.

44
00:03:16,650 --> 00:03:19,200
We'll do this in pairs.

45
00:03:19,200 --> 00:03:21,460
Mukubayashi with Hiwamura-sensei.

46
00:03:21,460 --> 00:03:23,460
Mizuki Mukubayashi!

47
00:03:24,260 --> 00:03:26,960
YEAH, MIZUKI MUKUBAYASHI
She's the sporty, popular girl in class

48
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:28,690
YEAH, MIZUKI MUKUBAYASHI
with top-notch social skills.

49
00:03:29,010 --> 00:03:30,700
Her 50-meter dash
is done in four seconds.

50
00:03:30,700 --> 00:03:33,650
About a hundred side-to-side jumps.

51
00:03:35,050 --> 00:03:40,360
Yowayowa-sensei versus Tough Girl?

52
00:03:40,360 --> 00:03:43,050
Huh? Feels like everyone's watching me.

53
00:03:43,050 --> 00:03:44,960
Guess I'll have to give it my all.

54
00:03:48,900 --> 00:03:51,300
Jump when I give the signal.

55
00:03:51,300 --> 00:03:52,250
Ready…

56
00:03:52,250 --> 00:03:53,000
HMM

57
00:03:53,250 --> 00:03:54,910
Hiyah!

58
00:03:56,460 --> 00:03:57,860
F-five meters.

59
00:03:57,860 --> 00:04:00,720
This is beyond
just setting a new world record.

60
00:04:01,900 --> 00:04:04,310
How's that, Kowakowa-sensei?

61
00:04:06,210 --> 00:04:08,310
She got blown over by the wind
from Mukubayashi's jump.

62
00:04:09,810 --> 00:04:10,910
A-are you okay?

63
00:04:10,910 --> 00:04:11,410
SITTING UP

64
00:04:12,660 --> 00:04:15,720
S-sorry, I didn't jump well.

65
00:04:15,710 --> 00:04:16,209
FAINTING
S-sorry, I didn't jump well.

66
00:04:17,050 --> 00:04:18,019
Sensei?

67
00:04:18,019 --> 00:04:18,709
INFIRMARY

68
00:04:18,700 --> 00:04:21,100
She's probably overexerted herself.

69
00:04:21,110 --> 00:04:22,510
Take off your top.

70
00:04:22,510 --> 00:04:25,150
Rest well and you should be fine.

71
00:04:25,150 --> 00:04:27,750
Okay, thank you.

72
00:04:29,310 --> 00:04:31,800
I need to step out.
Take care of her, please.

73
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:33,210
O-okay.

74
00:04:37,210 --> 00:04:39,710
Sorry, Abikura-kun.

75
00:04:39,710 --> 00:04:41,860
I can't believe I fainted.

76
00:04:41,860 --> 00:04:44,110
I couldn't even finish the test.

77
00:04:44,110 --> 00:04:46,310
Not at all, you tried your best.

78
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:49,300
But I'm really happy.

79
00:04:49,310 --> 00:04:50,910
She's happy?

80
00:04:51,400 --> 00:04:53,310
Experiencing class
just like the students do

81
00:04:53,310 --> 00:04:56,260
is such a valuable lesson.

82
00:04:56,260 --> 00:04:59,150
She goes all out in everything, 
doesn't she?

83
00:04:59,150 --> 00:05:00,910
I hope next time I can…

84
00:05:01,300 --> 00:05:02,160
DIZZY
Sensei, you should lie down.

85
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:03,700
Sensei, you should lie down.

86
00:05:03,700 --> 00:05:05,060
BUMP
Sensei, you should lie down.

87
00:05:07,210 --> 00:05:09,210
Um, sensei?

88
00:05:13,660 --> 00:05:17,210
DEEP SLEEP
I did ten side-to-side jumps…

89
00:05:17,410 --> 00:05:19,260
She's satisfied with ten jumps?

90
00:05:19,660 --> 00:05:23,260
Even her fitness test was not good.

91
00:05:25,250 --> 00:05:28,310
Kowakowa-sensei cursed you?

92
00:05:28,310 --> 00:05:31,210
Mizuki, I'm terrified.

93
00:05:31,210 --> 00:05:33,810
If I get cursed, save me, okay?

94
00:05:33,810 --> 00:05:35,260
L-leave it to me.

95
00:05:35,960 --> 00:05:38,350
My only strength is being really strong.

96
00:05:38,350 --> 00:05:40,250
I'll protect the whole class.

97
00:05:40,250 --> 00:05:43,160
It's reassuring
having such a strong friend.

98
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:47,460
That said, I'm a little scared too.

99
00:05:47,850 --> 00:05:51,450
But it's not good
to just label someone as terrifying one.

100
00:05:57,250 --> 00:05:59,110
YOSHIKAWA
Dolls with students' names?

101
00:05:59,110 --> 00:05:59,500
Dolls with students' names?

102
00:05:59,510 --> 00:06:01,100
Why is she bleeding?

103
00:06:01,100 --> 00:06:03,410
This is definitely not normal.

104
00:06:03,410 --> 00:06:06,610
YOSHIKAWA
It's a ritual to summon demons.

105
00:06:06,610 --> 00:06:07,750
TREMBLING
The evidence is undeniable.

106
00:06:07,750 --> 00:06:10,810
TREMBLING
Kowakowa-sensei really is a terrifying person.

107
00:06:11,110 --> 00:06:12,450
Eh?

108
00:06:12,450 --> 00:06:16,000
Mizuki Mukubayashi, with seat number 30?

109
00:06:16,010 --> 00:06:17,660
Did you forget something?

110
00:06:17,650 --> 00:06:19,800
Th-this is bad, Sensei.

111
00:06:19,810 --> 00:06:20,810
Though it's just my guess, 

112
00:06:20,810 --> 00:06:22,660
she looks absolutely terrified right now.

113
00:06:23,810 --> 00:06:26,510
YOSHIKAWA
There's no way to explain this away.

114
00:06:26,510 --> 00:06:28,310
H-how could this be?

115
00:06:28,310 --> 00:06:31,110
I was just practicing teaching
by using dolls as usual.

116
00:06:31,110 --> 00:06:32,800
Then I noticed one was a bit damaged, 

117
00:06:32,800 --> 00:06:34,200
and I tried to fix it, 

118
00:06:34,210 --> 00:06:37,310
but I accidentally pricked my hand.

119
00:06:37,310 --> 00:06:38,710
All Yowayowa incidents.

120
00:06:39,060 --> 00:06:41,360
Anyway, I need to clear up
this misunderstanding.

121
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:42,710
Wait, Sensei.

122
00:06:42,710 --> 00:06:45,650
Uh, Mukubayashi…

123
00:06:46,310 --> 00:06:48,000
What did I just say?

124
00:06:48,010 --> 00:06:51,010
N-no, it's… you see…

125
00:06:51,010 --> 00:06:52,660
I was practicing.

126
00:06:52,660 --> 00:06:54,260
Practicing a summoning ritual?

127
00:06:54,260 --> 00:06:58,160
S-so I used the dolls
to represent everyone!

128
00:06:58,160 --> 00:07:00,970
Turning students into dolls?

129
00:07:01,810 --> 00:07:04,610
So these are the victims?

130
00:07:04,610 --> 00:07:06,750
She's just digging herself deeper.

131
00:07:06,760 --> 00:07:10,120
Th-the rumors really are true.

132
00:07:10,110 --> 00:07:11,000
Rumors?

133
00:07:11,510 --> 00:07:14,410
They say Kowakowa-sensei wants to
rule our class with fear, 

134
00:07:14,410 --> 00:07:17,550
and then slowly
take over the whole school.

135
00:07:17,550 --> 00:07:19,260
That's ridiculous!

136
00:07:19,260 --> 00:07:21,910
When did the rumors get so dramatic?

137
00:07:21,910 --> 00:07:24,820
N-no, Mukubayashi-san…

138
00:07:24,820 --> 00:07:26,360
Stay away from me!

139
00:07:27,110 --> 00:07:30,110
The unprecedented harsh rejection
made her heart-broken.

140
00:07:30,510 --> 00:07:32,110
She was speechless.

141
00:07:32,110 --> 00:07:34,010
Mukubayashi, please let me explain.

142
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:34,800
Shut up!

143
00:07:35,210 --> 00:07:38,200
I'm talking to Sensei right now.

144
00:07:38,200 --> 00:07:40,560
I'm not talking to you, 
her brainwashed pawn.

145
00:07:40,560 --> 00:07:41,910
I'm brainwashed?

146
00:07:41,900 --> 00:07:43,450
TREMBLING
That's what everyone says.

147
00:07:43,450 --> 00:07:46,500
TREMBLING
Abikura is Sensei's first pawn

148
00:07:46,500 --> 00:07:50,200
TREMBLING
and the first poor familiar to be brainwashed.

149
00:07:50,210 --> 00:07:51,800
Everyone says that?

150
00:07:51,800 --> 00:07:54,800
We went to the same elementary school.

151
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:57,990
You're not the type
to volunteer to be class president.

152
00:07:58,000 --> 00:08:01,510
You used to be totally
unenthusiastic and gloomy.

153
00:08:01,510 --> 00:08:04,010
You've been influenced pretty badly.

154
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:05,750
They think I'm Sensei's minion.

155
00:08:06,150 --> 00:08:07,150
Enough!

156
00:08:08,150 --> 00:08:09,300
Huh?

157
00:08:09,650 --> 00:08:12,160
I'll protect this school!

158
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:14,900
This is also to save those
who've been turned into dolls!

159
00:08:14,900 --> 00:08:18,000
The Tough Girl has
a strong sense of justice.

160
00:08:18,610 --> 00:08:19,510
This is bad.

161
00:08:19,510 --> 00:08:22,860
Sensei doesn't stand a chance against her.

162
00:08:22,860 --> 00:08:26,110
Honestly, even I couldn't defeat her.

163
00:08:26,520 --> 00:08:28,210
We have no choice.

164
00:08:28,210 --> 00:08:31,710
Sensei, I'll hold her back. You run!

165
00:08:31,710 --> 00:08:35,530
Mukubayashi-san looks so strong.

166
00:08:35,950 --> 00:08:37,270
STUNNED

167
00:08:37,549 --> 00:08:39,809
You're scared of me too, 

168
00:08:39,809 --> 00:08:42,909
but you still stood up for everyone.

169
00:08:42,909 --> 00:08:45,200
I've always admired people like that.

170
00:08:45,210 --> 00:08:47,160
You've always been
the center of the class.

171
00:08:47,160 --> 00:08:49,610
You excel in physical tests too.

172
00:08:51,100 --> 00:08:53,050
So this really is a misunderstanding.

173
00:08:53,060 --> 00:08:55,860
How could I possibly hurt everyone…

174
00:08:56,820 --> 00:08:57,510
Sensei!

175
00:09:04,110 --> 00:09:07,160
M-Mukubayashi-san, I'm sorry.

176
00:09:08,410 --> 00:09:09,260
Sensei.

177
00:09:09,250 --> 00:09:12,310
I lost some blood earlier.
I think I'm feeling anemic.

178
00:09:12,310 --> 00:09:14,100
From that tiny cut?

179
00:09:14,100 --> 00:09:17,410
N-no way… Did I really misunderstand?

180
00:09:17,410 --> 00:09:18,200
The way she is now…

181
00:09:18,200 --> 00:09:20,050
PANTING
Rather than terrifying, 

182
00:09:20,050 --> 00:09:21,200
PANTING
she's incredibly weak.

183
00:09:21,550 --> 00:09:24,800
And so cheeky.

184
00:09:24,810 --> 00:09:27,160
I'm always causing you trouble, 
Abikura-kun.

185
00:09:27,160 --> 00:09:28,170
Always?

186
00:09:31,050 --> 00:09:32,410
Abikura.

187
00:09:32,410 --> 00:09:35,050
You often do this kind of thing, 

188
00:09:35,050 --> 00:09:37,610
taking advantage of Sensei
because she's helpless?

189
00:09:38,550 --> 00:09:41,510
Seems the one
I need to defeat isn't Sensei, 

190
00:09:41,510 --> 00:09:42,600
but you!

191
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:43,450
FURIOUS
But you!

192
00:09:43,450 --> 00:09:46,000
Sensei, please explain it to her!

193
00:09:46,010 --> 00:09:47,160
Sensei!

194
00:09:47,150 --> 00:09:49,000
We managed to clear up

195
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:50,680
the misunderstanding later, but…

196
00:09:51,700 --> 00:09:53,460
THE NEXT DAY

197
00:09:57,020 --> 00:10:07,000
(Yowayowa Sensei)

198
00:10:10,660 --> 00:10:11,260
Y-you're

199
00:10:11,260 --> 00:10:13,960
BLUSHING
doing something cheeky again!

200
00:10:13,960 --> 00:10:15,160
No!

201
00:10:15,160 --> 00:10:17,070
Sensei tripped while carrying documents

202
00:10:17,060 --> 00:10:19,050
and ended up on top of me.

203
00:10:19,060 --> 00:10:20,120
Really?

204
00:10:20,110 --> 00:10:22,310
Isn't the proof right here?

205
00:10:22,310 --> 00:10:24,050
Seriously, isn't school out?

206
00:10:24,050 --> 00:10:25,600
What are you doing here?

207
00:10:25,610 --> 00:10:28,010
I was about to ask you the same thing.

208
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:30,760
Well… because I'm class president.

209
00:10:30,770 --> 00:10:31,710
What?

210
00:10:31,710 --> 00:10:33,510
That doesn't suit you at all.

211
00:10:33,510 --> 00:10:35,800
I came to see Hiwamura-sensei.

212
00:10:35,810 --> 00:10:37,870
Y-you came to see me?

213
00:10:37,870 --> 00:10:39,570
I'm really sorry about yesterday.

214
00:10:39,560 --> 00:10:41,460
I said some awful things to you.

215
00:10:41,460 --> 00:10:43,310
I had the wrong idea about you.

216
00:10:43,310 --> 00:10:46,410
I always thought you were scary.

217
00:10:46,410 --> 00:10:48,910
But now I understand.

218
00:10:48,910 --> 00:10:52,120
You're just trying your best to teach us.

219
00:10:53,410 --> 00:10:56,060
Has someone finally understood Sensei?

220
00:10:56,060 --> 00:10:59,250
By the way, your name's Hiyori, right?

221
00:10:59,260 --> 00:11:00,860
Can I call you Hiyori?

222
00:11:00,860 --> 00:11:01,760
Hiyori?

223
00:11:02,160 --> 00:11:05,110
Only friends address each other like that.

224
00:11:05,110 --> 00:11:06,560
There's no way Sensei would agree.

225
00:11:07,400 --> 00:11:10,050
I'd be delighted!

226
00:11:10,060 --> 00:11:11,110
She cried from happiness.

227
00:11:11,110 --> 00:11:16,820
I… I've always wanted to be a teacher
who's friends with her students.

228
00:11:17,260 --> 00:11:20,660
And I've always wanted
to get along with you.

229
00:11:20,660 --> 00:11:21,540
HEART FLUTTERING

230
00:11:21,540 --> 00:11:23,960
BURSTING INTO TEARS
I should be the one apologizing.

231
00:11:23,960 --> 00:11:27,250
It's my fault for always doing things
that get misunderstood.

232
00:11:27,260 --> 00:11:29,460
Oh, stop crying.

233
00:11:29,450 --> 00:11:32,860
You're just too adorable.

234
00:11:32,860 --> 00:11:36,210
Why did I ever think you were scary?

235
00:11:36,210 --> 00:11:37,860
I'm always messing up.

236
00:11:37,860 --> 00:11:41,510
- They're getting close so fast.
- I know, I feel the same.

237
00:11:41,510 --> 00:11:44,810
Tough Girl's social skills
are top-notch.

238
00:11:44,810 --> 00:11:47,960
And Sensei looks even happier
than when she's with me.

239
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:48,960
That hurts.

240
00:11:48,970 --> 00:11:49,920
Anyway, 

241
00:11:49,920 --> 00:11:51,160
ASSERTIVELY
I think I should become

242
00:11:51,160 --> 00:11:53,460
ASSERTIVELY
the class president.

243
00:11:53,460 --> 00:11:54,760
ASSERTIVELY
Compared to Abikura, 

244
00:11:54,760 --> 00:11:57,280
ASSERTIVELY
I could definitely help you more.

245
00:11:57,560 --> 00:11:58,210
What?

246
00:11:58,210 --> 00:12:00,850
Mukubayashi, why are you saying this now?

247
00:12:00,860 --> 00:12:02,610
Speaking of him, 

248
00:12:02,610 --> 00:12:06,270
does he take advantage
of your kindness to grope you?

249
00:12:06,260 --> 00:12:09,010
He's not the type
to volunteer to be the class president.

250
00:12:09,010 --> 00:12:12,510
He must have approached you
with ulterior motives.

251
00:12:12,510 --> 00:12:15,070
I… I can't deny that.

252
00:12:15,070 --> 00:12:18,860
But I genuinely wanted to help too.

253
00:12:18,860 --> 00:12:22,560
A… Abikura-kun isn't like that.

254
00:12:23,460 --> 00:12:26,960
Abikura-kun wanted to become a go-getter.

255
00:12:26,970 --> 00:12:29,720
That's why he volunteered
to be class president.

256
00:12:29,710 --> 00:12:31,510
Oh right, I almost forgot that backstory.

257
00:12:32,070 --> 00:12:33,570
Huh? Is that true?

258
00:12:34,560 --> 00:12:35,710
You're pretty hardworking.

259
00:12:35,710 --> 00:12:38,010
But you just don't seem cut out
to be the class president.

260
00:12:38,010 --> 00:12:40,060
It's not too late. You should just quit.

261
00:12:40,060 --> 00:12:41,310
This girl…

262
00:12:41,310 --> 00:12:44,300
If I were the class president, 
I could give you tons of great advice.

